      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GO GO EVIE (1) comes off an average run last start when sixth at Shepparton over 390m behind Sharapova Star (22.64) in a Free For All. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Has ability and looks hard to stop. FIND THE SUN (7) has a strong overall record having 14 wins and 14 places from 39 starts including a last start success (24.54) over 435m at Sale. Performs well off this draw. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. PAW DANGER (8) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 2 lengths (22.44) behind I'm To Blame at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. ON THE RIVER (2) produced a strong 22.24 despite finishing fifth last start. Can measure up here.",
